<h1 class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;color:#111827">Alt-text drafts are running low</h1>
<p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827"><bdi>Example Outfitters</bdi> has used <bdi>1,800</bdi> of the <bdi>2,000</bdi> alt-text drafts in its plan.</p>
<p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827">The allowance renews on <bdi>November 1, 2026</bdi>.</p>
<table class="rs-text" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 16px;color:#111827"><tbody><tr><th scope="row" class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-right:16px">Alt-text drafts used</th><td class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:right"><bdi>1,800</bdi> of <bdi>2,000</bdi></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827">Scans, findings and the fixes you already approved keep working.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0"><a class="rs-button" href="https://admin.shopify.com/store/fixture-store/apps/rampsmith/plan" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#1d4ed8;border:2px solid #1d4ed8;border-radius:6px;color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:24px;padding:10px 20px;text-decoration:none">Compare plans</a></p>
